  door D2 at:0.3 name:客室扉
boundary /L6..L12/hn03 /L6..L12/corr t:180 spec:戸境RC
  door D2 at:0.3 name:客室扉
boundary /L6..L12/hn04 /L6..L12/corr t:180 spec:戸境RC
  door D2 at:0.3 name:客室扉

# 外皮
